<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/eng@/~cl_14> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 15 the following section: “Centralization of information 15. (1) A reporting institution, or the director, officer or employee of the reporting institution shall establish, administer and maintain a system for centralization of information collected pursuant to this Part. (2) For the purposes of subsection (1), the competent authority may issue any directions, instruction, guideline, circular, standard, notice, specification or requirement to, or impose any condition on, the reporting institution, or the director, officer or employee of the reporting institution on the form and manner of the centralization of information."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/eng@> .
