<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/eng@/~cl_4__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after the definition of “property” the following definition: ‘ “proliferator property” means— (a) proceeds from the commission of any restricted activity; (b) property that has been, is being, or is likely to be used by a proliferator to commit any restricted activity; (c) property owned or controlled by or on behalf of a proliferator to commit any restricted activity, including funds derived or generated from such property; or (d) property that has been collected for the purpose of providing support to a proliferator or funding of any restricted activity;’;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/eng@> .
